<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,371.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,371.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,371 today from 1,367 on July 10, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1448    13.150	  1441    13.086</p>
<p>   1a   1360 10300.000	  1355 10264.000</p>
